WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.395
Use sound patterns and known word parts to draft words, then verify conventional

00:00:05.395 --> 00:00:06.195
spellings carefully.

00:00:07.033 --> 00:00:10.767
What is the right spelling of a school subject? Answer: science

00:00:11.617 --> 00:00:15.691
Prepare a spelling journal of ten difficult reading words and check each one.

00:00:16.533 --> 00:00:19.328
Why it works: Science is the conventional form.
